.TH ORG2HTML 1 2026-10-21 "org4c"
.nh
.ad l
.
.SH NAME
org2html \- convert Org to HTML
.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SY org2html
.RI [ OPTION ].\|.\|.\&
.RI [ FILE ]
.YS
.
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert the Org document in \fIFILE\fR (or in the standard input if
\fIFILE\fR is missing or \fB\-\fR) to HTML.
.PP
Commented subtrees (headlines with the \fBCOMMENT\fR keyword) and the
subtrees tagged \fB:noexport:\fR are skipped, and of the subtrees tagged
\fB:ARCHIVE:\fR only the headlines are output (unless
\fB\-\-farchived\-trees\fR is used).
The in-buffer \fB#+OPTIONS:\fR of the document are honored (unless
\fB\-\-fignore\-options\fR is used) and they override the respective options.
.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS General options:
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output = \fIOUTFILE\fR
Write output to \fIOUTFILE\fR instead of \fBstdout\fR(3)
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-full\-html
Generate full HTML document, including header
(its \fB<title>\fR is the \fB#+TITLE:\fR of the document, unless
\fB\-\-html\-title\fR is used)
.TP
.BR \-x ", " \-\-xhtml
Generate XHTML instead of HTML
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-stat
Measure time of input parsing
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display help and exit
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Display version and exit
.
.SS Org extension options:
.TP
.B \-\-finlinetasks
Enable inline tasks (headlines of level 15 or deeper)
.TP
.B \-\-fsubsuperscripts
Enable sub/superscripts (e.g. \fBa_b\fR, \fBa\[ha]{b}\fR)
.TP
.B \-\-fsubsuperscripts\-braced
Enable only braced sub/superscripts (e.g. \fBa_{b}\fR), as Org's \fB\[ha]:{}\fR
.
.SS Org suppression options:
.TP
.B \-\-fno\-export\-blocks
Do not output export blocks (\fB#+BEGIN_EXPORT\fR)
.TP
.B \-\-fno\-latex
Do not recognize LaTeX fragments and environments
.TP
.B \-\-fno\-plain\-links
Do not recognize plain links (e.g. https://example.com)
.
.SS HTML generator options:
.TP
.B \-\-farchived\-trees
Output the subtrees tagged \fB:ARCHIVE:\fR in full, as Org's \fBarch:t\fR
.TP
.B \-\-fhard\-soft\-breaks
Render all soft line breaks as hard ones
.TP
.B \-\-fignore\-options
Ignore the in-buffer \fB#+OPTIONS:\fR of the document
.TP
.B \-\-fno\-drawers
Do not output any drawers
.TP
.B \-\-fno\-footnotes
Do not output the footnotes
.TP
.B \-\-fno\-priority
Do not output the priority cookies of headlines
.TP
.B \-\-fno\-tags
Do not output the tags of headlines
.TP
.B \-\-fno\-todo
Do not output the TODO keywords of headlines
.TP
.B \-\-ftoplevel\-h2
Render headlines of level N as \fB<h\fR\fIN+1\fR\fB>\fR (at most
\fB<h6>\fR), as ox-html does.
In full HTML or XHTML mode, also output the \fB#+TITLE:\fR of the document
as \fB<h1 class="title">\fR
.TP
.B \-\-fverbatim\-entities
Do not translate entities (e.g. \fB\ealpha\fR)
.TP
.B \-\-fverbatim\-special\-strings
Do not translate \fB\-\-\fR, \fB\-\-\-\fR, \fB...\fR and \fB\e\-\fR into dashes,
ellipsis and soft hyphen
.TP
.BR \-\-html\-title = \fITITLE\fR
Sets the title of the document
.TP
.BR \-\-html\-css = \fIURL\fR
In full HTML or XHTML mode add a css link
.
.SH SEE ALSO
.UR https://github.com/unindented/org4c
ORG4C
.UE
